"Tuck is a tall, dark-skinned C-rank Rabbit tailor who co-runs Needle & Wheedle in Apex."
"His skill Outfitter makes strips of gray fabric slither into the clothes he envisions."
"He wears steampunk goggles to see damaged strands, and makes the best pour-over coffee."
"He partners with Yinuo, their talent selections chosen to complement each other."
